Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Ordered Topology Inventory Digest Data Design

Description: Unsigned Data-Driven Design quality-gate record for the supplied ordered-inventory digest. It defines data identity, ownership, relations, transforms, lifecycle, provenance, and physical representation without adding persistence, decoding, effects, or receipt authority.

